==History==
2016
*The Fire Spirits [[Cards|card]] was added to the game on 3/5/2016, in the [[Version History#May 2016 Update (3/5/2016)|May 2016 Update]].
*On 18/5/2016, a [[Version History#Balance Changes (18/5/2016)|Balance Update]], increased the Fire Spirits' area radius to 1.5 tiles (from 1.2 tiles).
2018
*On 2/7/2018, a [[Version History#Balance Changes (2/7/2018)|Balance Update]], increased the Fire Spirits' damage by 5%.
2020
*On 2/6/2020, a [[Version History#Balance Changes (2/6/2020)|Balance Update]], gave the Fire Spirits a new 0.1 seconds deploy stagger from each other.
*On 9/9/2020, a [[Version History#Balance Changes (9/9/2020)|Balance Update]], increased the Fire Spirits' area radius to 1.7 tiles (from 1.5 tiles).
2021
*On 7/6/2021, the [[Version History#Summer%202021%20Update%20(7/6/2021)|Summer 2021 Update]], reworked the card, decreasing its cost to 1 [[Elixir]] (from 2 Elixir), its unit count to 1 (from 3), increasing its hitpoints by 109%, its damage by 6%, its range to 2.5 tiles (from 2 tiles), and its area radius to 2.5 tiles (from 1.7 tiles). Its name and description were updated to reflect the count change. Its description previously read, “''These three Fire Spirits are on a kamikaze mission to give you a warm hug. It'd be adorable if they weren't on fire.''” It also moved the [[Arenas|Arena]] to unlock the Fire Spirit from Spell Valley to P.E.K.K.A's Playhouse.
*On 6/9/2021, the [[Version History#2021%20Quarter%203%20Update%20(6/9/2021)|2021 Quarter 3 Update]], decreased the Fire Spirit's area radius to 2.3 tiles (from 2.5 tiles).
*On 27/10/2021, the [[Version History#Champions%20Update%20(27/10/2021)|Champions Update]], increased the Level cap of all cards to 14 (from 13).
*On 7/12/2021, the [[Version History#Balance Changes (7/12/2021)|2021 Quarter 4 Update]], decreased the Fire Spirit's range to 2 tiles (from 2.5 tiles).
2022
*On 2/8/2022, a [[Version History#Balance Changes (2/8/2022)|Balance Update]], decreased the Fire Spirit's damage by 9%.
*On 26/10/2022, the [[Version History#2022%20Quarter%203%20Update%20(26/10/2022)|2022 Quarter 3 Update]], moved the Arena to unlock the Fire Spirit from P.E.K.K.A's Playhouse to Spell Valley. It also added the No Escape [[Card Mastery]] task for the Fire Spirit.
2023
*On 19/6/2023, the [[Version History#Card%20Evolution%20Update%20(19/6/2023)|Card Evolution Update]], increased the Level cap of all cards to 15 (from 14).
2025
*On 4/2/2025, a [[Version History#Balance Changes (4/2/2025)|Balance Update]], increased the Fire Spirit's range to 2.5 tiles (from 2 tiles).
*On 30/6/2025, the End of June 2025 Update, added a card render to the Fire Spirit's card info screen.
2026

* On 4/8/2026, a Balance Update, decreased the Fire Spirit's hitpoints by 6%

