==Trivia==
*While not available as a troop in Clash of Clans, the Fire Spirit reappears there in a few situations.
**The Fire Spirit is used from one of the Siege Machines, the [https://clashofclans.fandom.com/wiki/Flame_Flinger Flame Flinger]. 
**The Fire Spirit is seen on top of the [https://clashofclans.fandom.com/wiki/Super_Miner Super Miner]'s helmet as a lighter.
**The Firemites (resembles Fire Spirit) is spawned from the [https://clashofclans.fandom.com/wiki/Furnace Furnace].
*The Fire Spirit, along with [[Skeletons]], [[Electro Spirit]], [[Ice Spirit]], [[Warmth]], [[Heal Spirit]], and [[Heal]], are the cheapest [[cards]], costing 1 [[Elixir]].
*Among all troops with area damage, the Fire Spirit has the largest area damage radius of all [[:Category:Troop Cards|troops]], with a radius of 2.3 tiles.
*The Fire Spirit is 1 of 8 troops to die as a part of their attack, the others being the Electro Spirit, Ice Spirit, [[Skeleton Barrel]], [[Battle Ram]], Heal Spirit, [[Suspicious Bush]], and [[Wall Breakers]].
*It was the only “Spirit” card to have a spawner [[:Category:Building Cards|building]] version, which was the [[Furnace]] before 4/8/2025.
*The Fire Spirit is 1 of 9 troops that have the same sprite for both players, the others are Skeletons, Electro Spirit, [[Bats]], Ice Spirit, Heal Spirit, [[Elixir Golem|Elixir Blob]], [[Phoenix]], and [[Lava Hound|Lava Pup]].
*In the French, Italian, Portuguese, Malaysian, and Finnish language settings of the game, the Fire Spirit's name translates to "Spirit of Fire". In the Russian, Chinese, and Persian language settings of the game, the Fire Spirit's name translates to "Fiery Spirit", "Flame Spirit" and "Fiery Soul" respectively.
*The Fire Spirit is 1 of 23 troops that has been featured in the [[Troop Rush]] game [[:Category:Modes|mode]], the others being Skeletons, [[Skeleton Dragons]], Bats, [[Elite Barbarians]], [[Firecracker]], [[Rascals|Rascal Girls]], [[Royal Hogs]], Heal Spirit, Elixir Golem, [[Guards]], [[Prince]], [[Balloon]], [[Golem]], Wall Breakers, [[Ram Rider]], [[Sparky]], Phoenix, [[Royal Ghost]], [[Bandit]], [[Lumberjack]], [[Santa Hog Rider]], and the [[Monk]].
*The Fire Spirit is 1 of 23 cards that has had its Elixir cost changed, the others being [[Bomber]], [[Royal Recruits]], [[Cannon]], [[Mortar]], [[Musketeer]], [[Three Musketeers]], Heal, [[Goblin Hut]], [[Bomb Tower]], [[Barbarian Hut]], Furnace, [[Elixir Collector]], [[Skeleton Army]], [[P.E.K.K.A.]], Wall Breakers, [[Electro Giant]], [[Bowler]], [[Goblin Barrel]], [[Barbarian Barrel]], [[Rage]], [[Fisherman]], and the Monk.
*2 Fire Spirits are featured on the card image of the [[Rune Giant]]. Another Fire Spirit is featured on the card image of the [[Berserker]].
*The Fire Spirit's mouth is seen in "[https://youtu.be/5FXOdOySfsI?si=aK3PbidZSTSPF9fx The Evolution of Furnace!]" video.
**It's also shown that the Fire Spirit has a feminine voice.
*The Fire Spirit is the only card in English whose name has changed, as a result of its count changing from 3 to 1 in the [[Version History#Summer%202021%20Update%20(7/6/2021)|Summer 2021 Update]].
*In [[Touchdown]], if a Fire Spirit jumps into the enemy end zone as it attacks, it does not count as a touchdown. This is because a jumping spirit no longer counts as a troop; it becomes similar to a projectile.
*The Fire Spirit is the subject of 3 [[Emotes]].
*The Fire Spirit was featured in the winning [[Battle Decks|deck]] of the [https://www.youtube.com/live/nMANpDweTA4?si=nsUAou7ny3WAA2ve Clash Royale League 2022 Tournament], by a player called Mohamed Light.

